Issue #3541883: Custom fields without field_ prefix are not extracted for translation
https://git.drupalcode.org/project/ai_translate/-/work_items/3541883

Adapted from upstream MR !19 (target 1.3.x):
https://git.drupalcode.org/project/ai_translate/-/merge_requests/19

Adaptation note: the upstream diff also removes a 'description' entry from
$supportedFieldNames. That entry does not exist in the 1.3.1 tag, so the hunk was
re-cut against the released file. Logic is otherwise identical to MR !19.

Select fields by their field definition (the translatable flag configured in content
language settings) instead of by hardcoded field-name patterns, so fields not prefixed
with field_ (e.g. schema_abstract) are translated, and non-translatable fields
(e.g. entity references left untranslatable) are not.

Remove when the fix lands in a tagged ai_translate release.

